{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-1","kind":"proposition","title":"有圆求作合圆线与所设线等此设线不大于圆之径线","englishTitle":"Into a given circle to fit a straight line equal to a given straight line which is not greater than the diameter of the circle.","book":4,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.1/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","contentId":"euclid-4-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bcaeb9b5653f1f4b41e7e2a5490af3f42b7b77ee691c11c9c242fc9a1fa2f091","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-1.statement","euclid-4-1.construction.1","euclid-4-1.construction.2","euclid-4-1.proof.1","euclid-4-1.proof.2","euclid-4-1.proof.3","euclid-4-1.proof.4","euclid-4-1.proof.5","euclid-4-1.historical.1","euclid-4-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-1","revisionId":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb64c730d1f727b768b172c26998d281544ae01c364f11848793c34db59f3672","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Into a given circle to fit a straight line equal to a given straight line which is not greater than the diameter of the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一个给定的圆上,适合等于不大于圆直径的给定直线的直线。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作合圜线与所设线等此设线不大于圜之径线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有一个圆，找出组合圆线和设定线等，其中设定线不大于圆的直径。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-1","revisionId":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a98641d29fcf7e6be92e39b79dcebd926aaa3581fc71ff5087e8ad0f9612b5f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be the given circle, and D the given straight line not greater than the diameter of the circle; thus it is required to fit into the circle ABC a straight line equal to the straight line D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC是给定的圆,让D是给定的直线,不大于圆的直径;因此,它必须把等于直线D的直线划入圆内。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-1.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-1","revisionId":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31fe3cfa0b82d827ddbb671f6c9122af1787d2b9c590a43b9e06b62b9e9e4824","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a diameter BC of the circle ABC be drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘制ABC圆的直径BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-1","revisionId":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56fed3324cf387b2f89b9fa8256e66514dbc86586e5a22f1601be4970896d484","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, if BC is equal to D, that which was enjoined will have been done; for BC has been fitted into the circle ABC equal to the straight line D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果BC等于D,那么按要求完成的任务就已经完成;BC已经安装在ABC圆,等于D直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-1","revisionId":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99271c7af6f2db686388fc0c8935fba03c9773f19d677bd2c68f1a63770d747c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if BC is greater than D, let CE be made equal to D, and with centre C and distance CE let the circle EAF be described; let CA be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果BC大于D,CE等于D,中点C和距离CE则表示EAF;连接CA。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-1.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-1","revisionId":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"57834142ebba80b441ab7791320e45490f2e1b76aae1374e414cc92e49b70d2b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the point C is the centre of the circle EAF, CA is equal to CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C点是EAF点的中心,CA等于CE点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-1.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-4-1","revisionId":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"060b96d141f6d83836e1be6bb3a0c9d58df2f3d4e8d8ea9bfe513dda1f56b084","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CE is equal to D; therefore D is also equal to CA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CE等于D,因此D也等于CA。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-1.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-4-1","revisionId":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19d2298a33abb337fa859ca2b6a666eec88a6bda9ca66d9d76bf5048561267f9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore into the given circle ABC there has been fitted CA equal to the given straight line D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定的ABC圆内装有CA等于给定的直线D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-1.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-1","revisionId":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2fbb76582bad48548a5a473114c6e7fdab59280642f128b3e20deb63535047bd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作合圜线与所设线等此设线不大于圜之径线法曰甲乙丙圜求作合线与所设丁线等其丁线不大于圜之径线〈径为圜内之最大线更大不可〉〈合见三卷十五〉先作甲乙圜径为乙丙若乙丙与丁等者即是合线若丁小于径者即于乙丙上截取乙戊与丁等次以乙为心戊为界作甲戊圜交甲乙丙圜于甲末作甲乙合线即与丁等何者甲乙与乙戊等则与丁等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有一个圆，找出圆和等于圆直径的设定线。绘制方法如下：甲乙丙 圆找到等于设定 丁 线的组合线。丁 线不大于圆的直径 〈径为圆内之最大线更大不可〉〈合见三卷十五〉 先画 甲乙，圆的直径为 乙丙。如果 乙丙 等于 丁，则为封闭线；如果 丁 小于直径，则在 乙丙 上切 乙戊 和 丁，以 乙 为中心，戊 为边界，甲戊 与圆 甲乙丙 相交。在 甲 末端，画 甲乙 作为连接点，等于 丁。如果 甲乙 和 乙戊 相等，则 丁 等于 丁。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-1.source","contentId":"euclid-4-1","revisionId":"euclid-4-1@raw-bcaeb9b5653f1f4b","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f910528978eec8f3ab79ce2ff0f1c239f37051923a5e6902afc554a3f89607c3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.1/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.1\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-10:euclid-4-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-10.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"IV. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-13:euclid-4-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-13.construction.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.13/","sourceLabel":"IV. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-23:euclid-4-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-23","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-23.construction.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.23","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.23/","sourceLabel":"IV. 1"}}],"dependencies":[],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-10:euclid-4-1:explicit","id":"euclid-4-10","book":4,"number":10,"kind":"proposition","title":"黄金三角形的尺规构造","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-13:euclid-4-1:explicit","id":"euclid-10-13","book":10,"number":13,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-23:euclid-4-1:explicit","id":"euclid-11-23","book":11,"number":23,"kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：平面与角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-polygon","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
